The Newgrange Passage Tomb was built in 3500 BC, making it older than Stonehenge and the Pyramids. {{Source|S1E13}}

[[Scarlet Byrne]] theorized that the Irish [[Seeker]] [[Cú Chulainn]] had to defeat a water Titan or clear a water trap in order to find the [[amulet]] of [[Gybolg]]. He eventually sealed the amulet within an obelisk in the secret chamber. {{Source|S1E13}}

Years later, Scarlet and Dante's team travelled to Newgrange Passage Tomb to investigate. After locating the secret chamber's entrance, [[Sophie Casterwill]] managed to open it with [[Breakspell]], albeit for a short amount of time due to the immense power of the Seeker who sealed it. Scarlett then discovered and bonded with Gybolg, then summoned it to fight alongside Dante's team against [[Klaus]]' [[Suits]] and defeat one of their [[Bonelasher]] Titans. {{Source|Home Turf}}

